   508	A sidecar `ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/7.4/custody.json` adds the tarball's
   509	SHA-256 and byte size. Weights, tarballs and replays stay out of git in the
   510	ignored locations above; only the manifest and receipts are committed. The model gets no opponent
   511	identity, seed or seat information beyond its own legal view, and
   512	checkpoint selection uses no opponent identity.
