   529	- The **parent harness** logs, from outside the agent process. `main.py` never
   530	  imports `wandb`, and `wandb` is never bundled into the tarball.
   531	- The JSON receipt under `ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/7.4/` stays the source-bound
